pseudo-Boolean proof version 2.0
* Positive companion to incorrect/version2/order_definition_sol: the same
* unsatisfiable formula, proven unsatisfiable the honest way. What the
* placement gate must not do is make the order definition itself unusable, so
* the same `pre_order` block is defined and loaded here.
f 2
pre_order simple
    vars
        left u1
        right v1
        aux
    end
    def
        -1 u1 1 v1 >= 0 ;
    end
    transitivity
        vars
            fresh_right w1
        end
        proof
            proofgoal #1
                p -2 -3 + -1 +
            end -1
        end
    end
end
load_order simple x1
load_order
p 1 2 +
output NONE
conclusion UNSAT : -1
end pseudo-Boolean proof
